---
title: Deploy pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    %% A CI pipeline with stages
    dev([Developer]) -- push --> repo[(Git repo)]
    subgraph ci [Continuous integration]
        direction TB
        build[[Build]] --> test{Tests pass?}
        test -->|no| fail>Notify author]
        test -->|yes| pkg[/Package artifact/]
    end
    subgraph cd [Delivery]
        stage{{Staging}} -.-> prod((Production))
    end
    repo ==> build
    pkg --> stage
    prod --- monitor[\Monitoring\]
    classDef danger fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b1d1d
    class fail danger
    style prod stroke-width:3px
    linkStyle 0 stroke:#2A78D6
